  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "材料製程學",
    "sub_ename": "THE MANUFACTURING AND PROCESSING OF MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "除了本身材料的天性外，材料的製程往往決定其表現與可用性。材料製程學主要集中在一般材料，為一提供近代及多元的材料製造方式的課程。其課程內容涵蓋鑄造、塑性成形、粉末製程、固化成形、實驗及量測法等專業領域，以及其不同的熱處理與表面處理方式以課堂授課、報告與測驗等方式建立學生基本學理的基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "In addition to the nature of the material itself, the manufacturing process of the material often determines its performance and usability. Materials Processing has a strong focus on materials in general, providing up-to-date, inter-disciplinary courses for materials processing. The content of the courses offered within this specialization will cover the areas of casting, plastic forming, powder processing, solidification, experimental methods and metrology. Various methods of heat and surface treatments will also be introduced for the purpose of establishing student’s basic knowledge of the subject by teaching, reports and examinations.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能用自己的詞彙定義何謂材料製程，描述重要的材料製程中之特性和現象\r\n\r\n",
      "describe_en": "Define materials processing with their own words, Be able to describe important quality and phenomenon in materials processing."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能區別並解釋材料製程在工程及學術層面的重要性。",
      "describe_en": "To make the differentiation and be able to explain the importance and effects of materials processing to academia and engineering."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "知道於何處可找到材料製程的相關資訊及研究結果。",
      "describe_en": "Know where to locate and access related materials processing information, research, and be able to evaluate the appropriateness of the obtained information."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能以書面或口頭方式將所獲結果與同儕、助教及教師溝通。\r\n",
      "describe_en": "Communicate results in written or oral form to classmates, teaching assistants, and the instructor."
    }
  ],
